Rocket.Chat view for Element Web (element-views kit "rocketchat")
===================================================================

This kit is shipped together with Element Web and runs inside it as a client view. It consists of:

1. Rocket.Chat client code, upstream tag 8.9.0, plus the patch queue in the element-views track repository
   (kits/rocketchat). Only the parts of Rocket.Chat outside the "ee/" and "apps/meteor/ee/" directories are used;
   those parts are under the MIT (Expat) licence:

       Copyright (c) 2015-2022 Rocket.Chat Technologies Corp.

   The full text of Rocket.Chat's licence file, including the MIT permission notice, is reproduced unchanged in
   LICENSE.rocketchat.txt next to this file. No Rocket.Chat Enterprise ("ee/") module is part of this build
   (checked on the webpack module graph by tools/licence-check.mjs). Rocket.Chat's logo and name marks are replaced;
   "Rocket.Chat" is a trademark of Rocket.Chat Technologies Corp. and is used here only to name where the code
   comes from.

2. The kit's own adapter code (kits/rocketchat/src):

       Copyright 2026 inblock.io (copyright holder and licence to be confirmed by the owner)

   proposed licence: AGPL-3.0-only OR GPL-3.0-only, as the track's Element-side files. Files in src/ that replace a
   Rocket.Chat file (each says so in its first comment) are derived from MIT code and keep its notice above.

